Excluded material

1. Receiver face code, stylesheets and textures — Creative Commons Attribution
   4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), with the attribution stated in ASSETS.md.

2. Third-party material — each item remains under its own license, as listed
   in NOTICE.md, including:
     - Map data derived from CShapes 2.0 (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) and Natural Earth
       (public domain): */geo/period-borders-*.json and */geo/reveal-regions.json
     - Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1): */vendor/fonts/, tools/face-overlay/fonts/
     - D3 libraries (ISC License): */vendor/LICENSE-d3-*.txt and the files they cover
     - Shortwave Radio Audio Archive item descriptions (CC BY-NC 3.0):
       data/release/sraa-item-descriptions-2026-10-20.json
     - Background static recordings (Public Domain Mark 1.0): */audio/seasonal/

3. Archival broadcast recordings are not included in this repository. They are
   streamed from their original hosts, chiefly the Internet Archive, under
   whatever terms those hosts and rights holders apply. Nothing in this
   repository grants or implies any license to those recordings.
